          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "一種目勝つごとに歩合百円なら、出ます",
          "en": "A hundred yen commission per win? Then I'm in."
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-5-1",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "出るわよ。地下で、全種目!!",
          "en": "We're in. Basement, every event!!"
