          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "実況は広報課!! 解説は本庁の部長です!!",
          "en": "Play-by-play from PR!! Commentary from the main building's director!!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-1-2",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "最後は下剋上綱引き!! 最下位が首位に挑めます!!",
          "en": "The last event is the Upset Tug-of-War!! Last place can challenge first!!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-1-3",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "caption",
          "ja": "日曜日。梨ヶ坂市民体育館。",
          "en": "Sunday. Nashigasaka Citizens' Gymnasium."
        },
        {
